# Product name guidance requirements

## REQ-M5-WAVE1-NAMING-001: Use the current product name in generated guidance
Priority: must
Type: functional
Pattern: ubiquitous
Statement: The system shall use the current CLI and package name `musubix5` in user-facing recovery guidance and newly generated consumer artifacts without presenting the retired name as an executable command or generated-artifact owner.
Acceptance: missing trace guidanceは`musubix5 trace build`、missing model-correspondence guidanceは`npx musubix5 evidence refresh`、初期quality guidanceは`musubix5 gate`、生成`.gitignore`は`musubix5 generated caches`、SMT/Lean headerは`Generated by musubix5`を含むこと。missing trace guidanceのtoken replacementは先行する`REQ-M5-WAVE1-TRACE-002` batchが所有し、本要求のRedは残り5箇所の少なくとも1つで失敗し、Greenは統合済みtrace guidanceを含む全6箇所を検証すること。baseline fixture、legacy repository identity、`MUSUBIX3_Z3`/`MUSUBIX3_LEAN`、attestation key-binding fragment `musubix3-key-id`/`musubix3-key-sha256`、およびcompatibility oracleの`package: 'musubix3'`は変更せず、authoritative test `TEST-M5-WAVE1-PRODUCT-NAMING-001`が意図した6箇所と全互換性除外を検証すること。
